---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getSiteConfig } from '../lib/site';

const { contactEmail } = await getSiteConfig();
const lastUpdated = 'November 12, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How DeCorte Industries handles information collected through this website.">
  <!-- INVENTED COPY: review. Generic privacy notice written for the redesign preview; no source text existed. -->
  <p class="eyebrow">privacy</p>
  <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy notice</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-xs text-smoke">Last updated {lastUpdated}</p>

  <div class="mt-8 max-w-2xl space-y-8 text-smoke">
    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What this covers</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        This notice explains what information DeCorte Industries collects when you visit this website,
        book a call, or email us, and how we use it. It doesn't cover the services we deliver under a
        client agreement; those terms are set in the agreement itself.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">What we collect</h2>
      <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>
          <span class="text-ink">When you book a call:</span> the name, email address, and any notes you
          enter in the booking form. Booking is handled by Cal.com, which processes that information under
          its own privacy policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="text-ink">When you email us:</span> your email address and whatever you choose to
          include in the message.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="text-ink">When you browse:</span> standard request data such as IP address, browser
          type, and pages requested, recorded by our hosting provider (Cloudflare) for security and
          reliability. Fonts are loaded from Google Fonts, which receives your IP address when it serves them.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-3">
        We don't use advertising trackers, we don't run third-party analytics, and this site doesn't set
        its own cookies. The booking widget may set cookies needed for it to work.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How we use it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        We use what you send us to reply to you, schedule and hold the call you booked, and talk about
        possible work together. We don't sell your information or share it with anyone for their own
        marketing.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How long we keep it</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        We keep booking details and email for as long as we need them to follow up and keep normal
        business records, then delete them. You can ask us to delete them sooner.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Your choices</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        You can ask what information we hold about you, ask us to correct or delete it, or ask us to stop
        contacting you. Email
        <a class="font-medium text-signal underline hover:text-signal-dark" href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>
        and we'll take care of it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Changes</h2>
      <p class="mt-3">
        If this notice changes, we'll update it here and change the date at the top.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
